well, maybe three --

00:08:15.227 --> 00:08:17.964
eh, three's basically
a bottle, so...

00:08:17.964 --> 00:08:19.298
Next.

00:08:19.298 --> 00:08:21.467
♪♪

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:23.402
Thank you, karaoke, for being
the most fun way

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.605
