but worse.

00:08:26.605 --> 00:08:27.773
[ Music stops ]

00:08:27.773 --> 00:08:29.041
-Music.
[ Music resumes ]

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:30.876
The next one.

00:08:30.876 --> 00:08:32.111
Thank you --

00:08:32.111 --> 00:08:40.319
♪♪

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:42.688
Thank you, wiping down
my groceries,

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:45.324
