00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:50.896
And that's it right there.
Thank you very much, everybody.

00:08:50.896 --> 00:08:53.299
We'll be right back with
"The Longest Days of Our Lives"

00:08:53.299 --> 00:08:55.000
